### Instagram Graph API - Deprecation of Media and User Insights

Source: https://developers.facebook.com/docs/graph-api/changelog/version18.0

This section details the deprecation of certain legacy Instagram insight metrics in version 18.0 and later. It specifies the affected endpoints and metrics, providing guidance on alternative metrics.

```APIDOC
## GET /{ig-user-id}/insights

### Description
Retrieves insights for an Instagram user. Certain metrics are being deprecated.

### Method
GET

### Endpoint
`/{ig-user-id}/insights`

### Parameters
#### Query Parameters
- **metric** (string) - Required - The insight metric to retrieve. Deprecated metrics include `AUDIENCE_GENDER_AGE`, `AUDIENCE_LOCALE`, `AUDIENCE_COUNTRY`, `AUDIENCE_CITY`.

### Response
#### Success Response (200)
- **data** (array) - An array of insight data objects.

#### Response Example
```json
{
